# Backend API base (no trailing slash). Leave empty in development: the app uses the computer running
# `expo start` (port 4000), or 10.0.2.2 on the Android emulator.
# For a phone on the same Wi-Fi you can also set it explicitly, e.g. http://192.168.1.20:4000
# For production builds: https://api.yourdomain.com
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
